notes.content:
And here's the update finally coming out!

So, what's new.

- 9 new CG;
- 5 new BG;
- 7 frames;
- new costumes for some characters.

I'm hoping to get the whole game finished this year. There are only two chapters left, so I think we'll get through it~
Thanks for following the project!

Hi! 
It's been quite a while since chapter five was released. The summer was awfully hot, so work stalled, but I'm fine now, and I plan to have chapter six out by the end of the year.

So, what's new?

- New 6 CGs. No more plans for now, but who knows? Ready 4 CGs;
- 4 new BGs are planned. + the weather has changed, so some of the backgrounds need fixes. Ready 3 BGs;
- The main character's new costume, Samantha's too;
- An important new character.

And some pictures~

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42792636/011b5c3108f108deff68337dcc6f72118d096077.jpg[/img]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42792636/11e909a5db0909f95c7026e54324285a7ffb4fd3.jpg[/img]

Hey! 
I want to talk about the progress of chapter five.

* the text is 70%~ ready;
* All 4 illustrations for fairy tales are ready. There will be fewer of them in the next chapters. Only Cole's storyline will remain;
* One secondary sprite has been added. There may be one more;
* A new background has been added. I plan to make a second one;
* Made 2 CG's, the third is in sketch form. Planning to add more;
* Daniel's chapter is already in the code;
* The relationship progress screen is made, and a button on the textbox is made for it.

[img]https://sun9-39.userapi.com/impg/aK7okKQsxpl4VfD3XLC-G-foWcOGsRQ1v013gw/GsnpsA8arvQ.jpg?size=1366x368&quality=95&sign=482ab72cd728f6d8240317301a078367&type=album[/img]

March was hard, for some reason it was hard to get my head together, but progress is being made.

Hi!
Here's the release of chapter two, where the protagonist gets to know all the love interests and learn more about her new home and the danger that threatens her.
Also a reminder of what has been added:

So, what's new:
- About an hour of reading, same as the first chapter;
- +4 new CG;
- +2 new tales and art for them;
- +3 new BG, and also previous backgrounds are being gradually improved;
- A new costume for the MC;
- a partially updated interface.

The timing of the third chapter will be announced later.
We look forward to your feedback! It will help make the game better!

Hi!
We're working on the second chapter, as well as improvements to the first chapter and the game as a whole. 
The second chapter will come out around the middle of May.
What's new done?
- About an hour of reading, just like the first chapter;
- the MC will get to know all the love interests, and find out more about her new home;
- +4 new CG;
- +2 new tales and art for them;
- +3 new BG, and also previous backgrounds are gradually improving;
- a new costume for the MC;
- partially updated interface.
Only one BG and one fairy tale are not done now. Otherwise, everything is ready.
The release of the new chapter will be further announced.

See you soon! And thanks for following the game!
